---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: "ind-page"
permalink: "/webinars/index.html"
title: "Free AI Webinars for Australian Businesses | Ad On Group"
description: "Free monthly AI webinars for Australian businesses — accounting, healthcare, NDIS, real estate, construction and legal. Online, 45 minutes, open to anyone. Run by Claude Certified Associates at Ad On Group."
---
<main class="ind">

  <section>
    <p class="ind-eyebrow">Free monthly webinars</p>
    <h1>Free AI webinars for Australian businesses</h1>
    <p class="ind-lede">
      One session a month, each on a single real problem in a single industry. Free, online,
      45 minutes, open to anyone — you don't have to be a client, and you'll leave with
      something you can use that afternoon.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-actions">
      {% if webinarSchedule.upcoming.length %}
      <a class="ind-cta" href="{{ webinarSchedule.upcoming[0].url }}">Next: {{ webinarSchedule.upcoming[0].pretty }}</a>
      {% else %}
      <a class="ind-cta" href="/ai-enquiry/">Get told about the next one</a>
      {% endif %}
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="/ai-quiz/">Take the free AI audit</a>
    </div>
    <p class="ind-trust">
      <b>Trusted by over {{ proof.clientCount }} Australian businesses.</b>
      Australian-owned since {{ proof.since }}, rated {{ proof.rating }} from
      {{ proof.reviewCount }} Google reviews, and run by Claude Certified Associates.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-logos" aria-label="Businesses that work with Ad On Group">
      {% for c in proof.clients %}
      <img src="{{ c.src }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="120" height="40">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if webinarSchedule.upcoming.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>What's coming up</h2>
    <div class="ind-grid">
      {% for s in webinarSchedule.upcoming %}
      <article class="ind-card">
        <span class="wb-date">{{ s.pretty }} &middot; {{ s.prettyTime }}</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <h2>What a session is like</h2>
    <p>
      Forty-five minutes, one sector, one real problem. We work through actual tasks — the
      email nobody wants to write, the report that takes an afternoon — and show the workflow
      end to end rather than talking about what AI can do in principle. Questions at the end,
      and nobody chases you afterwards for turning up.
    </p>
    <ul class="ind-list">
      <li>Built for non-technical people who do the work daily, not for developers.</li>
      <li>Worked examples on the kind of documents your team already produces.</li>
      <li>No product demo, no slides about the future of work.</li>
      <li>Come with a task you'd like to hand over, leave with a way to do it.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who runs them</h2>
    <p>
      Claude Certified Associates at Ad On Group, delivering the same material they teach in
      our three-month program. Ad On Group has been an Australian business since
      {{ proof.since }}.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-people">
      {% for t in proof.trainers %}
      <a class="ind-person" href="{{ t.url }}">
        <img src="{{ t.img }}" alt="{{ t.name }}, {{ t.role }}" loading="lazy" width="120" height="120">
        <span><b>{{ t.name }}</b>{{ t.role }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if proof.aiReviews.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>What people say after the program</h2>
    <div class="ind-reviews">
      {% for r in proof.aiReviews %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}
      <figure class="ind-review">
        <div class="ind-stars" aria-label="{{ r.rating }} out of 5">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>{{ r.text }}</blockquote>
        <figcaption>{{ r.name }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="ind-trust">Rated {{ proof.rating }} from {{ proof.reviewCount }} Google reviews.</p>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if webinarSchedule.past.length %}
  <section>
    <h2>Already run</h2>
    <p>These have been and gone. The pages stay up, and the recordings live in the academy.</p>
    <div class="ind-more">
      {% for s in webinarSchedule.past %}<a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <div class="ind-note">
      <h2>Why they're free</h2>
      <p>
        We run a paid three-month training program, and these sessions are how people find
        out whether we're any good before spending money with us. That's the whole model.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Recordings go to academy members rather than the public</strong> — it's what
        our members pay for. Come to the live one if the topic matters to you, and if you
        want every session plus the full program, that's what
        <a href="/programs/">the training</a> includes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Or go straight to your industry</h2>
    <p>Each session pairs with a program built around that sector's actual work.</p>
    <div class="ind-more">
      {% for i in industries.items %}<a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Save your spot</h2>
    <p>
      Free, online, 45 minutes, one Tuesday a month. Register for the next session and we'll
      send the link and a reminder on the morning.
    </p>
    <div class="ind-actions">
      <a class="ind-cta" href="/ai-enquiry/">Register for the next session</a>
      <a class="ind-cta-alt" href="/ai-quiz/">Take the free AI audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
